full-query: "A large IT company has used AWS ECS to deploy dozens of Microservices. There is a new requirement from management to report any state change of either ECS container instances or ECS tasks to a group channel in Microsoft Teams. The notification messages should be nicely readable and sent immediately whenever a status change happens. Which two methods in combinations can achieve this requirement? (Select TWO)"
